WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.910
The Dashboard is your business at a glance. Open it every morning, before anything else.

2
00:00:07.456 --> 00:00:16.440
Start with the Today card. Drafts waiting for approval and payment receipts are sent, declined or reviewed right here, with one button.

3
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:28.130
Then read the figures: contacts, today's messages, completed forms, instant replies, the average AI reply time, and the conversations waiting for your team.

4
00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:34.630
The Sales funnel shows which stage your customers are at, from the first message to the purchase.

5
00:00:35.182 --> 00:00:40.090
Latest messages lists the newest conversations. Click one to open it.

6
00:00:40.636 --> 00:00:48.600
A tip: if Waiting for the team is high, open Conversations, pick the Waiting for team filter, and answer them.
